
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ToonCraft AI</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#101323;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:22px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#191d32}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:bold;color:#9d8cff}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin-left:15px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:90px 20px}
h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,65px);margin:0 0 20px}
h1 span{color:#a18aff}
p{color:#c4c6d5;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
.btn{background:#8065ff;color:white;border:0;padding:15px 25px;border-radius:10px;font-size:17px;cursor:pointer}
.card{max-width:700px;margin:20px auto;padding:30px;background:#1b2038;border-radius:18px;text-align:center}
textarea{width:100%;height:130px;background:#101323;color:white;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:10px;padding:15px;font-size:16px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:35px;color:#999}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">🎬 ToonCraft AI</div>
<nav><a href="#">Home</a><a href="#create">Create</a></nav>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<h1>Create Amazing <span>AI Cartoons</span></h1>
<p>Turn your imagination into beautiful 3D cartoons.<br>Bring your stories to life with ToonCraft AI!</p>
<a href="#create"><button class="btn">Start Creating ✨</button></a>
</section>
<section class="card" id="create">
<h2>🎨 AI Cartoon Creator</h2>
<p>Describe your cartoon idea</p>
<textarea id="prompt" placeholder="Describe your character or cartoon story..."></textarea>
<br><br>
<button class="btn" onclick="alert('AI generation will be connected soon!')">Generate Cartoon ✨</button>
</section>
<footer>© 2026 ToonCraft AI. All rights reserved.</footer>
</body>
</html>
